<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#Expression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The intellectual or artistic realization of a work in the form of alphanumeric, musical, or choreographic notation, sound, image, object, movement, etc., or any combination of such forms.\n"@en .
